      distribute any other software or product;
  (c) discuss Cyclo publicly, and publish reviews, articles, technical
      analyses, screenshots and videos of the application;
  (d) quote short excerpts of the source code or texts where the law allows
      it (for example, for criticism, review, teaching or research), with
